      <h1 id="performanceprofile-performance-openshift-io-v2" class="group scroll-mt-20">PerformanceProfile [performance.openshift.io/v2]<a href="#performanceprofile-performance-openshift-io-v2" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
